"Goancho is such a neat and welcoming setup! I tried the Chicken Cafreal Poi and it was spot on — a perfectly crisp bun with an authentic burst of flavor. My friends tried the Chicken Chorizo, Prawnand Cran with Garlic Aioli & Mutton Donner versions. The ranch sauce paired beautifully, with just the right touch of salad on the side. The Lemon Iced tea is fantasic, although the peach version can improve a bit. Can’t wait to come back and explore more, wished for Pork & Buff options synonymous with Goan  Pao hence a 4/5!"🐐🥪

